  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "25146612",
      "title": "Adding More Components",
      "lectureOrder": 62,
      "videoOrder": 58,
      "sourceHash": "693c2fb2fef420aeb53ca474ba1dc6aca9cb6fcf079e15a2b15eec6e1f88cdff",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.02,
          "end": 5.62,
          "en": "Now let's start with creating the code for the overlay.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.62,
          "end": 8.01,
          "en": "For this, I'll add a new component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.01,
          "end": 11,
          "en": "We could add the code in the existing component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11,
          "end": 13.57,
          "en": "but it is considered a good practice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.57,
          "end": 17.05,
          "en": "to put every building block into its own file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.05,
          "end": 19.4,
          "en": "every component into its file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.4,
          "end": 22.62,
          "en": "and to avoid very long JSX blocks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.62,
          "end": 26.16,
          "en": "by instead splitting it up into separate components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.16,
          "end": 28.45,
          "en": "Now, when you should make a split,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.45,
          "end": 30.9,
          "en": "that's something which will come with experience.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.9,
          "end": 32.58,
          "en": "And you'll see a couple of examples",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.58,
          "end": 34.48,
          "en": "throughout this course here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.48,
          "end": 37.76,
          "en": "But in general, you wanna keep your component functions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.76,
          "end": 39.66,
          "en": "small and maintainable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.66,
          "end": 42.73,
          "en": "The JSX code that belongs to a component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.73,
          "end": 45.06,
          "en": "shouldn't become too complex.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 45.06,
          "end": 48.34,
          "en": "And therefore I'll add a new file in the components folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.34,
          "end": 50.74,
          "en": "and I'll name it modal JS",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 50.74,
          "end": 53.78,
          "en": "because that's the component that should be responsible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 53.78,
          "end": 56.61,
          "en": "for rendering a modal, this overlay.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 56.61,
          "end": 59.22,
          "en": "That's typically called a modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 59.22,
          "end": 61.82,
          "en": "And then here we therefore create another function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 61.82,
          "end": 63.35,
          "en": "the modal function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 63.35,
          "end": 67.95,
          "en": "and we export this function, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 67.95,
          "end": 71.35,
          "en": "And here we can also accept this props parameter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 71.35,
          "end": 72.38,
          "en": "As I mentioned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 72.38,
          "end": 75.11,
          "en": "every component function gets this parameter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 75.11,
          "end": 78.22,
          "en": "It's passed in automatically by React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 78.22,
          "end": 80.66,
          "en": "But of course, if you don't use this parameter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 80.66,
          "end": 81.493,
          "en": "in the function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 81.493,
          "end": 83.56,
          "en": "if you don't use it in a given component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 83.56,
          "end": 85.12,
          "en": "you can also omit it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 85.12,
          "end": 87.343,
          "en": "And here for the moment, I will omit it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 88.28999999999999,
          "end": 90.48,
          "en": "Then we need to return something here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 90.48,
          "end": 91.97,
          "en": "something which can be rendered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 91.97,
          "end": 93.42,
          "en": "by the browser as we learned.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 93.42,
          "end": 96.33,
          "en": "And for me, that will be another div.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 96.33,
          "end": 98.72999999999999,
          "en": "And in that div, we can then have a paragraph,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 98.72999999999999,
          "end": 102.173,
          "en": "let's say, with a text of, are you sure?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 103.03,
          "end": 104.84,
          "en": "Or something like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 104.84,
          "end": 108,
          "en": "And below that, let's say two buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 108,
          "end": 110.75,
          "en": "One button where we say cancel.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 110.75,
          "end": 113.86,
          "en": "And one button where we say confirm.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 113.86,
          "end": 117.2,
          "en": "Now in this demo, the buttons won't really do anything",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 117.2,
          "end": 119.86,
          "en": "except for closing the modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 119.86,
          "end": 121.58,
          "en": "But of course, in a bigger application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 121.58,
          "end": 124.1,
          "en": "you could then trigger different actions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 124.1,
          "end": 126.76,
          "en": "based on which button was clicked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 126.76,
          "end": 128.64,
          "en": "But again, that's just a first demo.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 128.64,
          "end": 131,
          "en": "We're going to see a slightly bigger app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 131,
          "end": 133.12,
          "en": "thereafter in this course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 133.12,
          "end": 134.79,
          "en": "So for the moment, it's this div.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 134.79,
          "end": 139.13,
          "en": "Let me format this with a paragraph and two buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 139.13,
          "end": 140.78,
          "en": "Now, we want to add some styling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 140.78,
          "end": 143.32999999999998,
          "en": "So on that div, I'll add a class name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 143.32999999999998,
          "end": 145.49,
          "en": "as you learned, of modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 145.49,
          "end": 148.44,
          "en": "And on the buttons, I'll also add some class names.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 148.44,
          "end": 150.34,
          "en": "On the cancel button, it's button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 150.34,
          "end": 154.41,
          "en": "And then another class named button dash dash alt.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 154.41,
          "end": 158.27,
          "en": "And these are simply classes to find in the index CSS file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 158.27,
          "end": 161.05,
          "en": "I provided to you earlier.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 161.05,
          "end": 164.363,
          "en": "And then here on the second button, it's just a button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 165.26,
          "end": 169.28300000000002,
          "en": "And that's now the markup for this overlay component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 171.07,
          "end": 173.05,
          "en": "Now, in addition to this overlay,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 173.05,
          "end": 175,
          "en": "we also wanna have a backdrop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 175,
          "end": 178.1,
          "en": "Some gray background behind the modal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 178.1,
          "end": 180.59,
          "en": "which blocks interaction with the page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 180.59,
          "end": 183.03,
          "en": "whilst the modal is opened.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 183.03,
          "end": 185.43,
          "en": "And for this, I'll add another component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 185.43,
          "end": 189.48,
          "en": "the backdrop component in a backdrop JS file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 189.48,
          "end": 193.35,
          "en": "And that will also be a straightforward component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 193.35,
          "end": 196.893,
          "en": "simply a backdrop function here like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 198.28,
          "end": 201.273,
          "en": "And then we export this as a default.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 202.14,
          "end": 204.96,
          "en": "And here I just want to return a div",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 204.96,
          "end": 207.77,
          "en": "with a class name of backdrop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 207.77,
          "end": 209.87,
          "en": "This div has no content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 209.87,
          "end": 211.27,
          "en": "and therefore we can write it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 211.27,
          "end": 213.75,
          "en": "as a self-closing tag actually.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 213.75,
          "end": 218.07,
          "en": "In standard HTML, you would not write it like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 218.07,
          "end": 221.47,
          "en": "There divs are not void tags,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 221.47,
          "end": 224.1,
          "en": "but in JSX you are allowed to do that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 224.1,
          "end": 226.18,
          "en": "if you have no actual content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 226.18,
          "end": 228.49,
          "en": "between the opening and closing tags.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 228.49,
          "end": 230.36,
          "en": "And here I just rendered this div",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 230.36,
          "end": 233.52,
          "en": "because of this styling which is added by this class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 233.52,
          "end": 235.26,
          "en": "And hence I need no content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 235.26,
          "end": 238.053,
          "en": "and hence we can write it like a self-closing tag.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 239.18,
          "end": 242.61,
          "en": "Okay, so now we've got the backdrop and the modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 242.61,
          "end": 244.04,
          "en": "Now we can use both.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 244.04,
          "end": 247.33,
          "en": "And for the moment, we will always show both.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 247.33,
          "end": 250.47,
          "en": "So for the moment, we can go to app JS, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 250.47,
          "end": 252.84,
          "en": "and below all these To do's,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 252.84,
          "end": 255.25,
          "en": "we can now also output the modal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 255.25,
          "end": 257.49,
          "en": "as a self-closing tag like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 257.49,
          "end": 261.5,
          "en": "and the backdrop as a self-closing tag like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 261.5,
          "end": 264.95,
          "en": "And we again need to import these two component functions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 264.95,
          "end": 266.81,
          "en": "in order to use them here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 266.81,
          "end": 270.72,
          "en": "So we import modal from dot slash components modal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 271.99,
          "end": 274.05,
          "en": "and we import backdrop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 274.05,
          "end": 277.793,
          "en": "from dot slash components backdrop, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 279.19,
          "end": 281.99,
          "en": "If you now save all your files,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 281.99,
          "end": 284.26,
          "en": "you should see something like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 284.26,
          "end": 285.49,
          "en": "Let me zoom out a bit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 285.49,
          "end": 286.93,
          "en": "Something like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 286.93,
          "end": 288.44,
          "en": "This is our modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 288.44,
          "end": 290.65,
          "en": "And at the moment, it's always visible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 290.65,
          "end": 292.01,
          "en": "and we can't close it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 292.86,
          "end": 295.88,
          "en": "because that's now one big missing piece.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 295.88,
          "end": 298.01,
          "en": "We know how to build components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 298.01,
          "end": 300.26,
          "en": "how to build reusable components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 300.26,
          "end": 302.71,
          "en": "and how to build our interface.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 302.71,
          "end": 307.47,
          "en": "But at this point, our interface is 100% static.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 307.47,
          "end": 308.83,
          "en": "It never changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 308.83,
          "end": 311.89,
          "en": "What we output here, that never changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 311.89,
          "end": 315.2,
          "en": "No matter how we interact with it as a user,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 315.2,
          "end": 318.17,
          "en": "the interface always stays the same.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 318.17,
          "end": 320.68,
          "en": "And of course, that's typically not what you want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 320.68,
          "end": 323.04,
          "en": "in a web interface.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 323.04,
          "end": 326.6,
          "en": "Things should be interactive and things should change.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 326.6,
          "end": 328.08,
          "en": "That's one of the main reasons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 328.08,
          "end": 331.1,
          "en": "for using a library like React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 331.1,
          "end": 332.78,
          "en": "And therefore let's now explore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 332.78,
          "end": 335.53,
          "en": "how React makes sure that we can change",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 335.53,
          "end": 338.83299999999997,
          "en": "what we see after the page was loaded.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
